earn More\nAccelerate Your Gaming\nVelocityX\nXLR8 Modding\nAccelerate Your PS5 Gaming\nGeForce RTX 50 Series\nGeForce RTX™ 50 Series Upgrade\nCommunity\nWallpapers\nCommunity\nShop\nSupport\nWhere to Buy\n0\nHome\nForms\nProfessional\nWebinars\nOn Demand Virtual Event\nPNY GEFORCE RTX™\n50 SERIES TRAINING\nWatch On-Demand\nAbout this Virtual Event\nThis training dives into the cutting-edge NVIDIA® GeForce RTX™ 50 Series GPUs, showcasing their revolutionary advancements in graphics technology and AI-enhanced performance. This session will help participants understand the capabilities of the new series of PNY GeForce RTX™ 50 Series graphics cards, how they enhance gameplay, boosts productivity, and redefine visual experiences. Attendees will learn how these GPUs leverage technologies like DLSS 4, real-time ray tracing, and other innovations to push boundaries in gaming, design, and AI applications.\nTOPICS TO BE COVERED:\nIntroduction to the PNY GeForce RTX™ 50 Series\nAdvancements in the new Blackwell architecture\nProduct overview including GeForce RTX 5090, RTX 5080, RTX 5070 Ti, and RTX 5070\nNew NVIDIA Features:\nNeural Rendering: What it is and why it matters\nDeep Learning Super Sampling (DLSS 4): Smarter scaling and improved performance\nReflex 2: How it helps gamers\nPerformance and Gaming Experience:\nHow the RTX 50 Series transforms gaming\nEnhancing competitive gameplay with better frame rates and latency\nElevate your gaming with PNY's VELOCITYX™ Overclocking Software\nSpeakers\nMatt Hummel\nSenior Product Manager,\nGeForce\nMatt Hummel is Senior Product Manager for GeForce at PNY. An avid tech enthusiast and a passionate gamer, Matt is focused on building products for gamers and creators that they will love.\nDerek Ellis\nSenior Manager, Product and Content Marketing,\nPNY Technologies\nDerek Ellis is the Category Manager of GPU Solutions at PNY and has been a part of their marketing team for nearly 7 years.\nRegister Now\nSupport\nProduct Support\nProduct Registration\nTechnology Glossary\nContact Us\nProduct Recalls\nCommercial RMA\nRetail RMA\nPro Partner Portal\nCompany\nWhy PNY\nAbout PNY\nPress Center\nPro in the News\nVirtual Events\nResource Center\nCareers\nWhere to Buy\nContact Us\nLegal\nLegal Overview\nPrivacy Policy\nCookie Policy\nTerms of Use\nTerms of Sale\nDisclaimer & 3rd Party Links\nOur Commitment to Accessibility\nConnect With Us\n© PNY Technologies Inc. All rights reserved.\n100 Jefferson Road,\nParsippany,\nNew Jersey\n07054\nUS\nBack to Top\nTerms of Use\nPrivacy Policy\nClose"
